# Project Context

This repository is option_quant_fund.

The project is an options quant research and data platform.

Current phase:
MVP 0.1 Data Platform Migration.

Current priority:
Foundational data landing comes before Greeks, backtest, and strategies.

Main workflow:
CEO plus CTO Agent plus Cursor plus GitHub.

GitHub Issues and Pull Requests are the formal source of truth.

Cursor must follow the current GitHub Issue.

Cursor must not expand task scope.

Cursor must not implement live trading.

Cursor must not implement broker integration.

Cursor must not implement order placement.

Cursor must not implement OMS or EMS.

Cursor must not implement Portfolio Risk Brain.

When in doubt, stop and ask for clarification.
